    /// ZEB-285 Task 7: `redeem_invite_inner` with `forked_from` + `pre_fork_snapshot`
    /// in the payload must:
    ///   1. Set `CommunityState.forked_from` on the joiner's engine.
    ///   2. Write `pre_fork_snapshot.bin` to `{identity_dir}/communities/{hex_id}/`.
